        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DDQ56 Solid Brass Dutch Door Quadrant</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Solid Brass Door Quadrant is used to lock upper and lower panels of a dutch door together.  Dutch doors are divided horizontally so the bottom half can remain closed keeping pets and small children safe inside while allowing light and air into the room. Available in 9 different finish colors. Includes mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFounded in 1977, Deltana is the architectural hardware manufacturer with a proven record for exceptional service and quality. From high-end residences to large commercial projects, Deltana is the nation\u0019s most complete provider of all of your door hardware needs.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DDQ56.gif?v=1704354507\" width=\"547\" height=\"249\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Dutch Door Quadrant Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-dutch-door-bolt-deltana-ddb425\"><b>Deltana Dutch Door Bolts</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Dutch Door Quadrant:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 4-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Height: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Includes matching finish mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Solid Brass Dutch Door Quadrant, Deltana DDQ56",
                "description": "Solid Brass Dutch Door Quadrant Deltana DDQ56 - This Solid Brass Door Quadrant is used to lock upper and lower panels of a dutch door together. Available in 9 different finish colors. Includes mounting hardware.\r\n",
